    rdf:value """Saturday, July 27, 1907
Oxford. Fine.
Bernhard went to Hampton Court with Mrs. Crawshay. I called on Heath and had my hand dressed, and then had a Turkish bath. My cold is awful, and I couldn’t enjoy the river, and, hardly, the sight of the youngsters swimming.
Agnes Conway has come for the week-end, an unusually nice girl, Ray’s friend."""^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 230 ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:part_of <https://mbdiaries.itatti.harvard.edu/resource/diary/1907> .

